const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"看起来持续，不一定是真正长记忆",en:"Persistent appearance is not true long memory"},body:{zh:"Corsi提出一个有限维、易估计的模型，说明多个不同时间尺度的短记忆成分也能形成很缓慢的相关衰减。标题中的“近似”很重要：有限样本中观察到持续性，不能单凭这一点认定生成过程具有真正的渐近长记忆。",en:"Corsi shows how a few short-memory components operating at different horizons can mimic slowly decaying dependence. The word approximate matters: persistence observed over a finite sample does not establish genuine asymptotic long memory."},reference:{url:"https://statmath.wu.ac.at/%7Ehauser/LVs/FinEtricsQF/References/Corsi2009JFinEtrics_LMmodelRealizedVola.pdf",label:{zh:"2009年期刊版 · §1",en:"2009 journal article · §1"}}},{title:{zh:"先辨认RV的单位",en:"Identify the units of RV first"},body:{zh:"这篇论文将一天内平方对数收益加总后开平方，称为已实现波动率；积分方差则是另一个量。相同缩写在其他文章中可能代表方差。对照模型、数据字段或误差指标时，必须先确认有没有开平方及年化处理。",en:"The paper calls the square root of summed intraday squared log returns realized volatility. Integrated variance is a different quantity. The same abbreviation can mean variance elsewhere, so transformations and annualization must be reconciled before comparing models."},reference:{url:"https://statmath.wu.ac.at/%7Ehauser/LVs/FinEtricsQF/References/Corsi2009JFinEtrics_LMmodelRealizedVola.pdf",label:{zh:"2009年期刊版 · §2.1 · equation (3)",en:"2009 journal article · §2.1 · equation (3)"}}},{title:{zh:"周成分是日波动率的平均",en:"The weekly component averages daily volatility"},body:{zh:"文中的周成分取最近五个日波动率的平均，较长成分采用相应窗口的平均。它不是先累加五天平方收益再开平方，两种运算次序不能交换。作者明确指出这种聚合定义是为了便于解释受约束的自回归模型。",en:"The weekly component averages the latest five daily volatility observations. It is not the square root of five days of summed squared returns. These operations are not interchangeable; the averaging convention supports the restricted-autoregression interpretation."},reference:{url:"https://statmath.wu.ac.at/%7Ehauser/LVs/FinEtricsQF/References/Corsi2009JFinEtrics_LMmodelRealizedVola.pdf",label:{zh:"2009年期刊版 · §2.1 · equation (4)",en:"2009 journal article · §2.1 · equation (4)"}}},{title:{zh:"不同期限是建模动机，不是账户识别",en:"Different horizons motivate the model, not investor identification"},body:{zh:"模型用日、周、月三个期限描述参与者反应速度的差异，并借此解释波动在不同尺度之间的联系。但这些成分是统计构造，不是观测到的散户、基金或养老账户。估计出某个期限系数，不能反推出具体投资者的行为。",en:"Daily, weekly and monthly horizons motivate heterogeneous responses across participants. These components are statistical constructs, not observed retail, fund or pension accounts. A fitted horizon coefficient does not identify the behavior of a particular investor group."},reference:{url:"https://statmath.wu.ac.at/%7Ehauser/LVs/FinEtricsQF/References/Corsi2009JFinEtrics_LMmodelRealizedVola.pdf",label:{zh:"2009年期刊版 · §2.2",en:"2009 journal article · §2.2"}}},{title:{zh:"用少数系数约束一串滞后",en:"A few coefficients restrict many lags"},body:{zh:"日、周、月成分同时进入下一期波动率回归，相当于对较长自回归中的滞后权重施加阶梯形限制。简洁来自这些限制，而不是没有使用历史信息。各成分共享部分日期，因此也不能把它们看成三个互相独立的实验。",en:"Regressing next-period volatility on daily, weekly and monthly components imposes step-shaped restrictions on a longer autoregression. Parsimony comes from those restrictions. The components share dates and must not be interpreted as three independent experiments."},reference:{url:"https://statmath.wu.ac.at/%7Ehauser/LVs/FinEtricsQF/References/Corsi2009JFinEtrics_LMmodelRealizedVola.pdf",label:{zh:"2009年期刊版 · §2.3 · equation (8)",en:"2009 journal article · §2.3 · equation (8)"}}},{title:{zh:"可观测波动率仍含测量误差",en:"Observed volatility still contains measurement error"},body:{zh:"从潜在波动率转到已实现波动率的推导保留了测量误差。原文特别提醒，一致性本身不足以推出有限样本误差均值为零。高频数据的噪声处理和采样间隔因此仍然重要，模型结构简单并不会自动消除这些测量问题。",en:"The link from latent to realized volatility retains measurement error. The paper cautions that consistency alone does not imply a zero-mean finite-sample error. Sampling intervals and microstructure treatment remain important even when the forecasting equation is simple."},reference:{url:"https://statmath.wu.ac.at/%7Ehauser/LVs/FinEtricsQF/References/Corsi2009JFinEtrics_LMmodelRealizedVola.pdf",label:{zh:"2009年期刊版 · §2.3 · footnote 10",en:"2009 journal article · §2.3 · footnote 10"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"HAR在有限尺度上模拟持续性，并不具有真正的渐近长记忆。本文使用的RV是平方收益和的平方根；不能与方差或对数方差模型直接混用。",en:"HAR approximates persistence over finite scales, without true asymptotic long memory. Here RV is the square root of summed squared returns, not variance or log variance."}};export{e as default};
